# Build artifacts
bin/
obj/
*.user

# ── SECRETS: never commit the real environment file ────────────────
# The .env file holds the live API key. Only .env.example (a template
# with placeholder values) belongs in version control.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Day-specific teacher notes (assignment.example.txt is the committed template)
assignment.txt

# Never commit captured images or generated reports, in case any are
# ever produced during debugging.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.pdf
kiosk_report*.html
# ...but the application icon artwork is part of the project.
!assets/icon.png
!assets/icon.ico
